 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGroupe Horizon SA                                              MASTER SERVICES\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo, 69001 Lyon, France                     AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR78 420638200\n\nFROM\n\nGroupe Horizon SA\n\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n69001 Lyon\nFrance\nVAT: FR78 420638200\n\n                                                              PAYÉ [circled]\n                                                              FACTURÉ À\n                                                              Atelier Provence SAS\n                                                              45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n                                                              75008 Paris\n                                                              France\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 27/01/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Groupe Horizon\nSA, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Lyon (\"Party A\"), and Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered office at 45 Avenue\nVictor Hugo, Paris (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Groupe Horizon SA / Pierre Martin\nParty B    Atelier Provence SAS / Pierre Martin\nDate       27/01/2026",
